  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Birthday Website**\n\nOkay, I\'m working on the initial website concept. My focus right now is on the visual design, specifically the color scheme. I\'m aiming for the \"Gabby\'s Dollhouse\" aesthetic, so I\'m thinking vibrant pastels: pinks, lavenders, and teals are at the forefront of my mind. The challenge will be to create a layout that\'s both fun and easy for parents to use.\n\n\n**Developing the Sensory Experience**\n\nI\'m now integrating sensory elements. Thinking bright yellow/gold sprinkles, \"kitty ear magic,\" and a \"sprinkle party\" feel. I\'ve chosen \"Zootopia\" sound cues and have designed the interactive envelope to trigger auto-playing music, with controls. We\'re prioritizing mobile-first design, aiming for an app-like experience with rich animations, and of course, a celebratory hero image of the celebrant.\n\n\n**Adding Interactive Features**\n\nMy focus has shifted to user interaction. I\'m excited about the countdown timer and dynamic map integration. The gift ideas section and RSVP form are coming together nicely, too. I\'ve drafted the party timeline and dress code details as well. The goal is to provide a seamless and engaging experience for guests, and I believe these additions will achieve that.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 409791948
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
