  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Color Palette Options**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the initial color palette options. I\'ve started with some \"Gabby Pink\" variations, including `#FF66B2`, `#FF70A6`, and `#FF4D94`. I\'m also looking at \"Mercat Teal/Sparkle Aqua\" with shades like `#4DCECE`, `#38B6FF`, and `#48CAE4`. Furthermore, I am considering \"Pandy Paws Lilac/Purple\", with shades `#9D4EDD`, `#B5`.\n\n\n**Expanding Visual Design Elements**\n\nI\'ve been exploring additional visual elements. I\'m excited about \"Cakey Sprinkles Yellow\" shades, alongside soft pastel backgrounds. I\'m also planning dollhouse patterns with kitty ears, sparkles, and more, as well as considering how to bring in the \"Zootopia 2 Party Soundtrack\".\n\n\n**Developing Interactive Features**\n\nI\'m now focused on interactive features, envisioning a re-seal option for the magical envelope opening. Also, I am crafting the celebrant\'s hero section, with a customizable photo frame, animated cat ears, and a ribbon banner. I\'m also including a calendar add feature, an A-Meow-Zing badge, and a dynamic countdown timer with animated number flips and confetti. I\'ve also incorporated party details, location, map links, and interactive directions.\n\n\n**Adding Party Logistics**\n\nI\'ve just added parking instructions, drop-off tips, and a gate code for party logistics. A one-click \"Copy Address\" toast notification will also be available for convenience.\n\n\n\n**Adding Party Details**\n\nI\'ve just added party details, like the \"Zootopia & Gabby Dance Party\" theme and a dress code. I\'m focusing on the interactive RSVP system, which will allow guests to enter their details and write a personalized birthday wish. I\'m also planning a party guestbook for birthday messages, and a mini-game to sprinkle glitter. I\'m working on `/src/types.ts` for data types, `/src/data/partyData.ts` for defaults, and components like `/src/components/InteractiveEnvelope.tsx` and `/src/components/MusicPlayer.tsx`.\n\n\n**Integrating Party Essentials**\n\nI\'m now integrating essential party elements. I\'ve got the \"Zootopia 2 Party Song\" on auto-play with track control and an animated soundwave indicator. I\'ve designed the celebrant hero section with animated kitty ears and confetti. I\'m also including a dynamic countdown timer. Additionally, I\'ve got venue details, gift registry, party timeline, party details, RSVP system, and wishes wall sections being built into the system.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 623842531
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
