    modified_response: "I have created the mobile-first **Gabby\'s Dollhouse Birthday Party Invitation** website featuring auto-playing party music and interactive animations:\n\n- **Interactive 3D Envelope**: Guests start with a pastel dollhouse envelope featuring a cat-ear wax seal button. Tapping the envelope opens the top flap, triggers sound effects with a multi-color confetti burst, and unfolds into the party invitation.\n- **Auto-Playing Zootopia 2 Soundtrack**: Seamlessly starts the upbeat *\"Try Everything\"* celebration party anthem upon opening the envelope, complete with a floating music player, volume slider, mute toggle, animated equalizer, and jukebox track switcher.\n- **Celebrant Hero Showcase**: Displays the celebrant\'s hero photo crowned with animated Gabby cat ears, a glowing *\"Turning 5!\"* badge, favorite quote, and a one-click Google Calendar integration.\n- **Live Countdown Timer**: Real-time ticker counting down days, hours, minutes, and seconds until the party kicks off.\n- **Location & Map Directions**: Venue card with direct links to **Google Maps** and **Apple Maps**, a one-click address copy button, parking notes, and a stylized interactive route map.\n- **Gift Ideas Registry**: Curated gift categories (Dollhouse sets, Arts & Crafts, Dress-Up, STEM toys), child sizing notes (clothing, shoes, favorite colors), and an interactive *\"I\'m Gifting This\"* claim system so guests don\'t buy duplicate gifts.\n- **Party Itinerary, Details & RSVP**: Features a 5-stage timeline, dress code guide, allergy notes, mobile RSVP submission form with headcount tracking, and a guest wishes wall."
