  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented an interactive **2.5D multi-plane parallax animation** in the Hero section using your 2 images (1 whole image and 1 cutout image with no background):\n\n- **Multi-Plane 2.5D Depth Architecture**:\n  - **Layer 1 (Background Scene)**: Displays the full/whole photo with an ambient color grade and atmospheric depth in the back plane (`translateZ(-20px)`).\n  - **Layer 2 (Midground Sparkles)**: Floating starlight and sparkles drift between the background and the celebrant.\n  - **Layer 3 (Foreground Cutout)**: The subject with no background is placed in the forward plane (`translateZ(45px)`) with realistic depth drop-shadows and enhanced parallax response.\n  - **Layer 4 & 5 (Toppers & Floating Badge)**: Crowned with the 3D Gabby cat ears and the floating *\"Turning 5!\"* celebration badge.\n- **Dynamic Interaction & Tilt**:\n  - **Cursor & Touch Motion**: Moving the mouse or dragging on mobile smoothly tilts the 3D stage with real-time `rotateX`, `rotateY`, and depth separation.\n  - **Scroll Parallax**: As you scroll down the page, the background and foreground move at differential rates for natural physical depth.\n- **Customization & Image Upload in Edit Modal**:\n  - Click **\"Change 2 Images\"** or **Settings** to customize both the **Whole Image** and **Cutout PNG Image**.\n  - Supports both **direct file uploads** (uploading straight from your computer/phone) and **image URLs**, complete with live preview cards and preset configurations."
    modified_response: "I have implemented an interactive **2.5D multi-plane parallax animation** in the Hero section using your 2 images (1 whole image and 1 cutout image with no background):\n\n- **Multi-Plane 2.5D Depth Architecture**:\n  - **Layer 1 (Background Scene)**: Displays the full/whole photo with an ambient color grade and atmospheric depth in the back plane (`translateZ(-20px)`).\n  - **Layer 2 (Midground Sparkles)**: Floating starlight and sparkles drift between the background and the celebrant.\n  - **Layer 3 (Foreground Cutout)**: The subject with no background is placed in the forward plane (`translateZ(45px)`) with realistic depth drop-shadows and enhanced parallax response.\n  - **Layer 4 & 5 (Toppers & Floating Badge)**: Crowned with the 3D Gabby cat ears and the floating *\"Turning 5!\"* celebration badge.\n- **Dynamic Interaction & Tilt**:\n  - **Cursor & Touch Motion**: Moving the mouse or dragging on mobile smoothly tilts the 3D stage with real-time `rotateX`, `rotateY`, and depth separation.\n  - **Scroll Parallax**: As you scroll down the page, the background and foreground move at differential rates for natural physical depth.\n- **Customization & Image Upload in Edit Modal**:\n  - Click **\"Change 2 Images\"** or **Settings** to customize both the **Whole Image** and **Cutout PNG Image**.\n  - Supports both **direct file uploads** (uploading straight from your computer/phone) and **image URLs**, complete with live preview cards and preset configurations."
